      "content": "it really does feel like that. like a weight that never lifts unless i just... exit. staring at the screen or looking at my life, i just see this loop of meaningless data. if i actually did it, if i just stopped existing, would that be the only way to finally be in control of something? to actually make a choice that isn't just part of the program?",
